cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the data, please cite the paper below."
title: "AntioxFP: graph neural networks for DPPH antioxidant activity prediction"
abstract: >-
  Code, curated data and trained models for predicting DPPH radical-scavenging
  activity (pIC50) from molecular structure with graph neural networks, with
  interpretability analysis, applicability-domain assessment and an independent
  validation set assembled from the primary literature.
